# case_id|mainnet_posture|prerequisite|campaign
#
# mainnet_posture is one of:
#   mainnet_ready      A new mainnet transaction is supported after all global
#                      custody/health gates and the named prerequisite pass.
#   process_reference  Demonstrate against a public mined transaction; there is
#                      deliberately no agent-facing constructor.
#   contained          The mainnet mutation is not currently available.
#   isolated_only      Policy deliberately forbids this shape on mainnet.
